WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.900
In Israel, hard water contains calcium and magnesium,

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.700
which form limescale that builds up on pipe walls.

3
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:11.450
A layer of scale coats the heating element
in the water boiler and the washing machine.

4
00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:15.100
Heating gets slower, uses more electricity,
and leads to breakdowns.

5
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:19.100
The combined main filter is installed on the main water line.

6
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.850
A 50-micron stainless-steel mesh
traps sand, rust and dirt,

7
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:26.700
and the combined cartridge prevents
scale buildup by up to 85%.

8
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:32.300
So the boiler, the washing machine and the pipes
stay protected from scale for years.

9
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:36.900
A.M Filters. Contact us today.
